 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+- No stall at a long request's start (patch `0018-server-tokenize-nogil`): the server tokenized each prompt
+  with `encode`, which holds Python's GIL for the whole text (~0.36 s at 256k tokens), so every other stream
+  stopped meanwhile. It now uses `encode_batch_fast` on the one text: the same ids, with the GIL released (a
+  counting thread keeps 98% of its rate during an 873k-token encode).
+
